    <string name="ski_tier_season">%1$s (%2$s rates)</string>
    <string name="ski_parking_note_palisades">Reservations are needed on weekends and holidays until 1 PM, and most are free. Spots paid for ahead cost $30. Weekdays need none.</string>
    <string name="ski_parking_note_northstar">Castle Peak is free. Village View takes a reservation on weekends and peak days, $20 for 3 or fewer and free for 4 or more. Preferred lots are $25 to $50.</string>
    <string name="ski_parking_note_sugar_bowl">The main lots are free, first come. Priority spots in the Upper Lot are $35 on some holidays and peak weekends.</string>
    <string name="ski_parking_note_heavenly">Boulder and Stagecoach are always free. California Base takes a reservation on weekends and peak days before 11:30 AM, $20 for 3 or fewer and free for 4 or more.</string>
    <string name="ski_parking_note_kirkwood">All lots take a reservation on weekends and peak days before noon. Lower 7 is free; most others are $20 for 3 or fewer and free for 4 or more.</string>
    <string name="ski_parking_note_sierra">$25 a day with a reservation on weekends and holidays until noon. Free for passholders, for cars of 4 or more, and after noon.</string>
